  unitName: Water Ghost
  unitId: 20202
  unitNumber: 257
  description: This subspecies of Metal Ghost is said to have changed after having
    amassed extensive records on the element of water. One must be patient in keeping
    company with them as they often complain by saying things like "I like cool places
    but I hate the cold," and "I don't like my food too hot or too cold." The element
    of water is much stronger in them than in normal Metal Ghosts, and it's said
    that when fused to other water types they provide loads more experience as well.
  summonDesc: You want my knowledge?<br>I don't mind giving it to you,<br>but can
    you use it?
